        },
        {
          "text": "Namichi toko ka Yusufu jed'ani, ka ergattuuni Barnaba jettuuni (Nama nama jabeesu jechu), ka gosa Lawi, ka lafa Kipro, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
